/-! TSKAJXY-XLLIPLS leaf 0, `atan1_box` expression — kernel-checked leaf.

The expression is `TskXLLIPLSExpr` with the 85 closed `atan 1` nodes emitted
as `TKind.atan1K` (library `pi4D` box) instead of `arctanI` at rung 2048.
`transReal .atan1K = transReal .arctanK = Real.arctan`, so the leaf states
the same real function; only the certificate enclosure changes (π/4 at one
`2^-64` ulp instead of ±`1/4097`).  `TMParams.sqrtCerts` are the mirror-
computed mantissas in traversal order.  Measured Taylor lower bound:
`+0.00087508603573064651024` (leaf 0), `+0.002822432042080472253717` (657);
the landed `.arctanK` emission was `-0.02393747527508621106` resp.
`-0.01891693053906524711`. -/

